<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia Q4 wage trends data due next week.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia Q4 wage trends data due next week.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Department of Industrial Relations said on Friday it expected to release its December quarter wage trends in enterprise bargaining report next week.</p>
<p>The department said it would announce on Monday on which day the report would be released.</p>
<p>-- Canberra Bureau 61-6 273-2730</p>
</text>
